Version Update: 1.05EA Minor Update - The Nine Tailed Celestial Fox
1.Fixed the main bug when building.
2.Add a new function to find others easily: player's cam now can follow any creatres on current scene by just click the small colored cirles on upper left side of UI. Including guest companion and boss. 
3.Fixed Enligsh UI;
4.Fixed sounds;
5.Fixed several other bugs.
